  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to \"7 Summers\", an upscale spacious beach cottage located in the quiet, gated community The Hammocks at Seagrove Beach. The Hammocks is a small family oriented community with charming coastal homes nestled in a forest of oaks and pines, located in the heart of 30A just minutes from Seaside. The Hammocks features 2 community pools as well as a private nature boardwalk that provides access to a stream that connects to Western Lake.<br><br>\"Someday\" is beautifully decorated and inviting. The large chef's kitchen is outfitted with professional grade appliances and is open to the living and dining area with plenty of workspace perfect for preparing your favorite family meal. The large dining table has seating for 8 and the spacious kitchen island has bar seating for 4. The living room features an open floor plan, high ceilings and an abundance of natural light, large flat screen smart TV and plenty of comfortable seating for the whole family.<br><br>A Master Bedroom is on the 1st floor and the upstairs contains a 2nd master, a king bedroom and a bunkroom. An additional seating area is also on the 2nd floor and set up perfect for the kids to chill and unwind after a day at the beach, with a variety of DVDs and games to enjoy. Three porches provide ample space to enjoy the peaceful nature of the neighborhood and the patio provides seating for 4 and a gas grill perfect for those who love outdoor cooking!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>1st Floor, Bedroom 1: Master suite, king bed, TV large private bathroom with dual vanity, walk-in shower<br><br>2nd Floor Bedroom 2: King bed, TV and private bathroom with dual vanities, tub and shower.<br><br> 2nd Floor, Bedroom 3: Master suite, king bed, TV and large bathroom with walk-in rain shower<br><br>2nd Floor, Bunkroom: 2- Twin over twin bunk beds with private bathroom and shower<br><br>Surrounded by the area’s natural beauty and teeming with nearby nature trails, The Hammocks invokes a sense of sanctuary and tranquility and is perfect for families looking for a quiet neighborhood yet just minutes from our famous sugar white sand beaches, world class dining and the famous coastal village of Seaside. The Hammocks perfectly encompasses the laid-back attitude and southern grace that make up the 30A lifestyle.<br><br>*parking limited up to 2 vehicles on-site (no exceptions)<br>*small pad in rear for one golf cart<br>*complimentary use of 4 YOLO bikes<br>*NO STREET PARKING PERMITTED<br>*no trailers, boats, RV's or personal watercrafts are permitted<br>*Hammocks 10 pm noise ordinance restriction is strictly enforced<br>*large gatherings in and outside of home are prohibited and in violation of the rental agreement<br>*no rentals to under age 25",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Great Rates! Beautiful Beach Cottage Located in The Hammocks"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
